# The compose project's `.env` (workdir.nix links it to /var/lib/krg/fishsense/.env,
# where `docker compose --project-directory` reads it). Committed, non-secret.
#
# COMPOSE_PROFILES: which profile-gated services a converge starts. Empty: the
# core stack only. `ops` (the smoke test) is never listed here; it runs by hand.
COMPOSE_PROFILES=
